  "notes": "{鳥類|ちょうるい} is the scientific classification term for birds.\n\n{鳥|ちょう} means \"bird\" and {類|るい} means \"class/category.\"\n\nNote: In everyday speech, {鳥|とり} is used. {鳥類|ちょうるい} is more formal/scientific.\n\nCharacteristics of birds:\n- {羽毛|うもう} (feathers)\n- {嘴|くちばし} (beak)\n- {卵|たまご}を{産|う}む (lay eggs)\n\nRelated classification terms:\n- {哺乳類|ほにゅうるい} (mammals)\n- {爬虫類|はちゅうるい} (reptiles)\n- {魚類|ぎょるい} (fish)",
